      "schema:description": "Vessel radius adjustments during optogenetic stimulation show 24 ± 28% variation relative to resting diameter, with dilations averaging 16.1 ± 14.3 µm and constrictions averaging 21.9 ± 14.6 µm relative to nearby neurons.",
